## 🛠️ Technology Stack

### Frontend

* React.js
* Next.js
* TypeScript
* Tailwind CSS
* HeroUI
* Framer Motion

### Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB
* Better Auth
* JOSE
* Stripe

